#: ../../source/docs/wheel-encoder.rst:5 d8514eda45f84a149f8310c5ac001b65
msgid "Wheel Encoders"
msgstr "轮式编码器"

#: ../../source/docs/wheel-encoder.rst:7 f5fd2a2757d648f3a61c737daf56fd9b
msgid ""
"Rover supports up to two \"AB\" wheel encoders like those in `this Pololu "
"motor <https://www.pololu.com/product/1442>`__ which can be used to improve "
"position estimation especially when no GPS is used."
msgstr ""
"Rover 最多支持两个「AB」式轮式编码器（如 `此款 Pololu 电机 "
"<https://www.pololu.com/product/1442>`__ 所用），可用于改善位置估计，尤其是在不使用 GPS 时。"

#: ../../source/docs/wheel-encoder.rst:14 9f27370985ea4ebcb7596b9f5aafe886
msgid "Connection and Setup"
msgstr "连接与设置"

#: ../../source/docs/wheel-encoder.rst:19 52d7b0c9df694373888c361f848ac5d9
msgid ""
"connect motor encoder's A and B outputs to the autopilot (A Pixhawk using "
"AUX OUT 3,4,5 and 6 pins is shown for example above)."
msgstr "将电机编码器的 A 和 B 输出连接到自动驾驶仪（例如上图使用 Pixhawk 的 AUX OUT 3、4、5、6 引脚）。"

#: ../../source/docs/wheel-encoder.rst:20 761435b818464fc99237a5c00aa6e88c
msgid ""
"set those output's ``SERVOx_FUNCTION`` to -1 to allow them to be used as "
"GPIO inputs. See :ref:`common-gpios` for more information. For the example "
"above, set :ref:`SERVO11_FUNCTION<SERVO11_FUNCTION>`, "
":ref:`SERVO12_FUNCTION<SERVO12_FUNCTION>`, "
":ref:`SERVO13_FUNCTION<SERVO13_FUNCTION>`, and "
":ref:`SERVO14_FUNCTION<SERVO14_FUNCTION>` to \"-1\"."
msgstr ""
"将这些输出的 ``SERVOx_FUNCTION`` 设为 -1，使其可作为 GPIO 输入使用。更多信息见 :ref:`common-"
"gpios`。对于上述示例，将 "
":ref:`SERVO11_FUNCTION<SERVO11_FUNCTION>`、:ref:`SERVO12_FUNCTION<SERVO12_FUNCTION>`、:ref:`SERVO13_FUNCTION<SERVO13_FUNCTION>`"
" 和 :ref:`SERVO14_FUNCTION<SERVO14_FUNCTION>` 均设为「-1」。"

#: ../../source/docs/wheel-encoder.rst:21 00b469092a444e76a17034c2a5a29f74
msgid ""
"set :ref:`WENC_TYPE <WENC_TYPE>` and :ref:`WENC2_TYPE <WENC_TYPE>` to 1 to "
"enable reading from two wheel encoders"
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`WENC_TYPE <WENC_TYPE>` 和 :ref:`WENC2_TYPE <WENC_TYPE>` "
"设为1，以启用从两个轮式编码器读取数据。"

#: ../../source/docs/wheel-encoder.rst:22 01316db5752f4f4c9f39e7871f96fe73
msgid ""
"set :ref:`WENC_CPR <WENC_CPR>` and :ref:`WENC2_CPR <WENC2_CPR>` to the "
"counts-per-revolution of the encoder.  This is the number of \"pings\" the "
"encoder will produce for each full revolution of the wheel"
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`WENC_CPR <WENC_CPR>` 和 :ref:`WENC2_CPR <WENC2_CPR>` "
"设为编码器的每转计数值，即每次车轮完整转一圈时编码器产生的「脉冲」数。"

#: ../../source/docs/wheel-encoder.rst:23 b98dc447580347b8b74030095f25994c
msgid ""
"set :ref:`WENC_RADIUS <WENC_RADIUS>` and :ref:`WENC2_RADIUS <WENC2_RADIUS>` "
"to the radius (in meters) of each wheel (i.e. 5cm radius would be 0.05)"
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`WENC_RADIUS <WENC_RADIUS>` 和 :ref:`WENC2_RADIUS <WENC2_RADIUS>` "
"设为每个车轮的半径（单位：米，例如5cm半径设为0.05）。"

#: ../../source/docs/wheel-encoder.rst:24 5aa86a84624744618131769c7e9755db
msgid ""
"set :ref:`WENC_POS_X <WENC_POS_X>` and :ref:`WENC_POS_Y <WENC_POS_Y>` to "
"define the first wheel's distance from the autopilot or COG (i.e. "
":ref:`WENC_POS_X <WENC_POS_X>` = 0.10, :ref:`WENC_POS_Y <WENC_POS_Y>` = "
"-0.05 means the wheel is 10cm ahead and 5cm left of the autopilot)"
msgstr ""
"设置 :ref:`WENC_POS_X <WENC_POS_X>` 和 :ref:`WENC_POS_Y <WENC_POS_Y>` "
"以定义第一个车轮相对于自动驾驶仪或重心的距离（例如 :ref:`WENC_POS_X <WENC_POS_X>` = "
"0.10、:ref:`WENC_POS_Y <WENC_POS_Y>` = -0.05 表示车轮在自动驾驶仪前方10cm、左侧5cm处）。"

#: ../../source/docs/wheel-encoder.rst:25 a543f989ad7d4d8796d334ad59d00def
msgid ""
"set :ref:`WENC2_POS_X <WENC2_POS_X>` and :ref:`WENC2_POS_Y <WENC2_POS_Y>` to"
" define the second wheel's distance from the autopilot or COG"
msgstr ""
"设置 :ref:`WENC2_POS_X <WENC2_POS_X>` 和 :ref:`WENC2_POS_Y <WENC2_POS_Y>` "
"以定义第二个车轮相对于自动驾驶仪或重心的距离。"

#: ../../source/docs/wheel-encoder.rst:26 864516ad33ec429289f0771dcbd660d6
msgid ""
"disable :ref:`relays <common-relay>` by setting :ref:`RELAY1_PIN "
"<RELAY1_PIN>` and :ref:`RELAY2_PIN <RELAY2_PIN>` to -1"
msgstr ""
"通过将 :ref:`RELAY1_PIN <RELAY1_PIN>` 和 :ref:`RELAY2_PIN <RELAY2_PIN>` 设为 -1 "
"来禁用 :ref:`继电器 <common-relay>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/wheel-encoder.rst:28 7b7160c53b3348e9b0654067f2b99e3c
msgid ""
"To enable position estimation using the wheel encoders the EKF3 must be used"
" and configured as follows:"
msgstr "要使用轮式编码器进行位置估计，必须使用 EKF3 并按如下方式配置："

#: ../../source/docs/wheel-encoder.rst:30 775f41ba2d9c47a6853ae9b54b5c75e4
msgid "set :ref:`AHRS_EKF_TYPE <AHRS_EKF_TYPE>` to 3 (means use EKF3)"
msgstr "将 :ref:`AHRS_EKF_TYPE <AHRS_EKF_TYPE>` 设为3（表示使用 EKF3）"

#: ../../source/docs/wheel-encoder.rst:31 62fe430fcdfa408a99bdce6becc45539
msgid "set :ref:`EK2_ENABLE <EK2_ENABLE>` to 0 (disable EKF2)"
msgstr "将 :ref:`EK2_ENABLE <EK2_ENABLE>` 设为0（禁用 EKF2）"

#: ../../source/docs/wheel-encoder.rst:32 0a9d20fb373d472c8eac65c8680e223c
msgid "set :ref:`EK3_ENABLE <EK3_ENABLE>` to 1 (enable EKF3)"
msgstr "将 :ref:`EK3_ENABLE <EK3_ENABLE>` 设为1（启用 EKF3）"

#: ../../source/docs/wheel-encoder.rst:33 931d8c0c49d54adda70e3adccaa80581
msgid "set :ref:`EK3_SRC1_VELXY <EK3_SRC1_VELXY>` to 7 (\"WheelEncoder\")"
msgstr "将 :ref:`EK3_SRC1_VELXY <EK3_SRC1_VELXY>` 设为7（「轮式编码器」）"

#: ../../source/docs/wheel-encoder.rst:34 587b846f70764bdcb5ccd5dd1df1589b
msgid ""
"(optionally) set :ref:`EK3_SRC1_POSXY <EK3_SRC1_POSXY>` to 0 (\"None\") to "
"disable use of GPS for horizontal position"
msgstr "（可选）将 :ref:`EK3_SRC1_POSXY <EK3_SRC1_POSXY>` 设为0（「无」）以禁用 GPS 用于水平位置估计"

#: ../../source/docs/wheel-encoder.rst:35 e7f4ea0b640c4510ac7904d7bb3e298b
msgid ""
"(optionally) set :ref:`EK3_SRC1_VELZ <EK3_SRC1_VELZ>` to 0 (\"None\") to "
"disable use of GPS for vertical velocity"
msgstr "（可选）将 :ref:`EK3_SRC1_VELZ <EK3_SRC1_VELZ>` 设为0（「无」）以禁用 GPS 用于垂直速度估计"

#: ../../source/docs/wheel-encoder.rst:37 9767283f3d634b29b1e891fb3d8d7bf2
msgid "After making the above changes the autopilot should be rebooted"
msgstr "完成上述更改后，应重启自动驾驶仪。"

#: ../../source/docs/wheel-encoder.rst:40 c220ab8e66264db0ab2b48fdb5c3586e
msgid "Ground Testing"
msgstr "地面测试"

#: ../../source/docs/wheel-encoder.rst:42 2f0852f22e1e49b0b7b63eee8087c775
msgid ""
"The ``WHEEL_DISTANCE`` MAVLink message shows the total distance travelled by"
" each wheel in real time.  Mission Planner's MAVLink Inspector can be used "
"which can be opened by pressing Ctrl-F and then pushing the \"MAVLink "
"Inspector\" button."
msgstr ""
"``WHEEL_DISTANCE`` MAVLink 消息实时显示每个车轮行驶的总距离。可使用 Mission Planner 的 MAVLink "
"查看器（按 Ctrl-F 后点击「MAVLink Inspector」按钮打开）查看。"

#: ../../source/docs/wheel-encoder.rst:47 6ec3b43fd1954f058eac87c6f1409f01
msgid "DataFlash logging"
msgstr "DataFlash 日志记录"

#: ../../source/docs/wheel-encoder.rst:49 7e461fd3127d4ecf87cc8442b5b6841d
msgid ""
"The wheel encoder data including total distance travelled by each wheel "
"appears in the WENC dataflash log messages."
msgstr "轮式编码器数据（包括每个车轮的总行驶距离）出现在 WENC DataFlash 日志消息中。"
